<div> <div data-custom-style="式中"> <p>Standard deviation, controlling the smoothing range. This deliberately longer explanation should wrap in its own column without shifting the symbols or the separators.</p> </div> <div data-custom-style="式中"> <p>A second paragraph retains <em>emphasis</em> and a <a href="https://example.org">link</a>.</p> </div> <ul> <li>
