</li> <li>
<div data-custom-style="式中"> <p>Its mathematical content <span class="inline math">x^{\textrm{T}}</span> stays editable.</p> </div>
</li> </ul> </div>
</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <p>Ordinary prose: 式中，<span class="inline math">k</span> 为核大小，<span class="inline math">\sigma</span> 为标准差。</p> <dl> <dt>Ordinary term</dt> <dd> An unmarked definition list stays an ordinary definition list. </dd> </dl> <div> <table data-autofit="window" data-cell_margin="0cm" data-custom-style="TableNoBorder" data-custom-text-style="式中"> <tbody> <tr> <td>
